; Rare goods of the traders (OGSM rare_items, Minister/Kirgudu). Adaptation SRP Freeplay: Eon.
; Each trader offers up to 3 random items from his list; the list is re-rolled every 1..3 game days.
; Outfits ported from OGSM (misc\fp_outfit.ltx) are included. Not taken: killer_* except killer_outfit, monolith_* except monolith_scientific_outfit, all heavy suits of stalkers/killers/monolith.

